@pytorchbot label "release notes: inductor"

Fixes #196233 — the generated AOTI MPS wrapper discarded both shim return codes, so a Metal compile failure dereferenced a null library handle instead of raising. @yushangdi confirmed the approach on the issue.

Could someone add the `actionable` label to #196233 and approve the CI workflows? Opened as draft until then.
